.TH show 1  "show " 
.SH NAME
show \- Show a single issue
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBshow\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-comments\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show a single issue
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output in JSON format
.TP
\fB\-\-comments\fR \fI<COMMENTS>\fR [default: none]
Comment projection: none, unresolved, or all (default: none)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
Issue ID
